.TH RUSTYPE-SETTINGS 1 "November 2026" "Rustype 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rustype-settings \- Graphical preferences editor and diagnostic tool for the Rustype input method
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rustype-settings
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rustype-settings
is the native desktop configuration tool for Rustype. Built with GTK4 and Libadwaita, it adheres to the modern GNOME Human Interface Guidelines (HIG), supporting automatic system dark and light appearance.
.PP
The tool runs as an independent preferences utility that modifies \fI~/.config/rustype/config\fR. Because it is completely decoupled from \fBibus-engine-rustype\fR, the engine itself remains ultra-lightweight with zero GUI dependencies in background memory. Changes made in the settings app are detected and reloaded automatically by the running engine.
.SH SECTIONS
.TP
.B General (Chung)
Configure primary input method (Telex or VNI), display composition mode (Auto, Preedit underline, or Direct), modern orthography (e.g. "hoà" vs "hòa"), English word auto-restore, and per-app state remembering.
.TP
.B Macros (Gõ tắt)
Manage abbreviation tables. Supports adding, editing, and deleting shortcut phrases, as well as importing and exporting Unikey-compatible macro tables.
.TP
.B App Modes (Theo ứng dụng)
Define custom input behavior overrides for specific applications (e.g., forcing terminal applications to use commit-mode preedit while allowing web browsers to use direct surrounding text).
.TP
.B Custom Words (Từ điển tiếng Anh)
Maintain an exclusion list of English or programming words that should never receive Vietnamese diacritics.
.TP
.B About & Diagnostics (Thông tin & Chẩn đoán)
Display version and license information, and execute the one-click system diagnostic health check with graphical status reports.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h\fR, \fB\-\-help
Show graphical application help and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/rustype/config
User configuration file edited by this application.
.TP
.I ~/.config/rustype/macro
Active macro abbreviations file.
.TP
.I ~/.config/rustype/words
User-defined English words dictionary.
